@baseUrl = https://localhost:7045

### List employees (filter + paging; total in X-Total-Count header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?search=&department=&page=1&pageSize=20

### Create an employee
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "phone": "+44 7700 900123",
  "salary": 72000,
  "department": "Engineering"
}

### Get the created employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Update it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada King",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "phone": "+44 7700 900123",
  "salary": 80000,
  "department": "Research"
}

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
